{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026trCPx0bKxw1793079464.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[13:52更新]</p><p>筲箕灣爆水管，水務署：一條18吋鑄鐵喉管損毀，筲箕灣及西灣河近一萬戶受影響，預計凌晨前完成修復。</p><p></p><p>[較早前報道]</p><p>筲箕灣有水管爆裂。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST-1230.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OwLIAolphz1793079474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>大量水湧出，淹及行人路及筲箕灣道來回行車線，駛經的車輛須涉水而行，有行人脫鞋赤腳走過。涉事的水管位於筲箕灣道潤民商業中心對出近新成街，早上10時許，懷疑受路面工程影響破裂。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST-1230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ze50Jc1uDA1793079471.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方上午近11時接報，附近一間老人院舍的玻璃窗在爆水管時破裂，一名82歲女院友腳部受傷，送往東區醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST-1230_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yYjZnXqika1793079469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:00.083439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:22.613629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:22.613629+00:00","content_hash":"5b73922050876eabe078f13aa7b8220105cc9d831c5cedb83bac1a86b9c701fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}